      "name": "Anonymous subclasses and multiple interfaces",
      "status": "partial",
      "scope": "Construct nongeneric source Kotlin, compiled Kotlin and Java base classes, pass constructor arguments and dispatch overrides that capture local and outer state. Additional supported interfaces and empty bodies are accepted. The unchanged AndroidBible VersesListeners class is checked with genuine dependencies.",
