    {
      "name": "Generic members with captures, overrides, defaults and varargs",
      "status": "partial",
      "scope": "Capture method and classifier type parameters in lambdas, override supported generic methods with renamed parameters and erased bridges, inherit default arguments, and dispatch checked reference varargs through generic abstract interfaces. The compiler checks read-only projected array access and publishes vararg metadata.",
